  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/7132e35b-1a2f-4178-9402-e85c68e9d11f-image3.jpeg\" /><br />Given, difference of the lengths of major and minor axis is <math><mn>10</mn></math>.<br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math> &hellip; (1)<br />One of the focii is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>5</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math> &hellip; (2)<br />Also <math><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math> .......(3)<br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>75</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>75</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn></math> &hellip; (4)<br />From (1) and (4)<br /><math><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math> and <math><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math><br />Hence length of the latus rectum <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8901;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>25</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math>",
